# Copy to .env (gitignored). All optional: with nothing set, `npm run
# scrape:linkedin` scrapes the logged-out guest view of the profile, which
# works only when LinkedIn isn't rationing guest views from this IP. Set one
# of the two below for a reliable source (LINKEDIN_RSS_URL wins if both set).

# Option 1 (recommended): RSS bridge feed for https://www.linkedin.com/in/james-weaver-cs/
# Create once at https://rss.app/rss-feed/linkedin by pasting the profile URL,
# then copy the generated feed URL here.
#LINKEDIN_RSS_URL=https://rss.app/feeds/XXXXXXXX.xml

# Option 2: your own LinkedIn session cookie (only ever use it on your own
# profile). DevTools on linkedin.com → Application → Cookies → li_at.
# Expires after a while — re-paste when the scrape reports an authwall.
#LI_AT=AQED...

# Optional: HTB app token for `npm run scrape` (HTB → Settings → App Tokens)
# enriches the Hack The Box card with machine owns + global ranking.
#HTB_TOKEN=
